1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,800
A vacant lot can become a shared garden when residents plan together.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:12,400
They test the soil, choose plants suited to the local climate, and build paths that are easier to navigate.

3
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:16,000
Volunteers take turns watering the beds through dry weeks.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:23,600
By autumn, the harvest is divided among neighbors, while the garden remains a place to meet, learn, and rest.
